{
  "info": {
    "name": "Team Admin API walkthrough",
    "description": "Companion collection for the Team Admin API [Get started walkthrough](https://aps.autodesk.com/en/docs/team_admin/v1/tutorials/get-started/). Follow the walkthrough for step-by-step instructions on using these requests.\n\n## Set up\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. Set `client_id` and `client_secret` to the credentials of your APS app.\n3. On the collection's Authorization tab, choose **Get New Access Token** and sign in as a team administrator (3-legged OAuth).\n\n## Scopes\nThe collection requests these scopes by default:\n- `tmadmapi:team:read`: team discovery and all read requests.\n- `tmadmapi:team-users:write`: invitations.\n- `tmadmapi:team-products:write`: creating and deleting assignments.\n\nWrite scopes do not grant read access, so the read scope is included.\n\n## Variables\nThe `url` variable is already set. Run the team discovery request, then copy the returned IDs into `team_id`, `user_id`, and `product_id`. Set `lookup_email` for the exact member lookup and `invite_email` for invitations.\n\n## Before you run write requests\nInvitation and assignment requests change the team. Invitations send email to the invitee.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "List administered teams",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams?limit=50",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "50"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Returns a page of teams you administer. Copy a returned id to team_id. To retrieve every page, keep limit unchanged and pass pagination.cursor until hasMore is false."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "List team users",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/users?limit=50",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "users"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "50"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Returns a page of members of team_id. Copy a returned id to user_id. Follow pagination.cursor with the same limit to retrieve additional pages."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Get one team user",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/users/{{user_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "users",
            "{{user_id}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Returns the member selected by team_id and user_id. An unknown user or a user outside the team returns 404."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Find a team user by exact email",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/users?email={{lookup_email}}",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "users"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "email",
              "value": "{{lookup_email}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Set lookup_email to the exact member email. No matching membership returns an empty data array. Follow pagination if hasMore is true."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "List product pools",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/product-pools?limit=50",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "product-pools"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "50"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Returns supported product pools for team_id. Copy a productId to product_id. Unlimited pools have null seat quantities; check startDate and endDate before assigning."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "List team assignments",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/assignments",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "assignments"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Returns effective assignments for team_id. Types are DIRECT, GROUP, and TEAM. All matching assignments are returned in data without pagination. Team-wide results can take time to reflect changes."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "List one user's assignments",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/assignments?userId={{user_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "assignments"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "userId",
              "value": "{{user_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Set user_id to a member ID. Returns effective assignments for that member; a user outside the team returns an empty list."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Find one user/product assignment",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/assignments?userId={{user_id}}&productId={{product_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "assignments"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "userId",
              "value": "{{user_id}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "productId",
              "value": "{{product_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Set user_id and product_id from discovery responses. Returns that effective assignment if present, otherwise an empty list."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Create direct team assignment",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"userId\":\"{{user_id}}\",\"productId\":\"{{product_id}}\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "text"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/assignments",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "assignments"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Creates a DIRECT assignment. Returns 201 for a new assignment or 200 for an existing direct assignment. Use tmadmapi:team-products:write; user_id and product_id are required."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Delete direct team assignment",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/assignments?userId={{user_id}}&productId={{product_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "assignments"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "userId",
              "value": "{{user_id}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "productId",
              "value": "{{product_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Sends userId and productId as query parameters with no body. Returns 204 when removed or absent, or 422 when only inherited access remains. Inherited access is preserved. Requires tmadmapi:team-products:write."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Invite team user - sends invitation",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"email\":\"{{invite_email}}\",\"firstName\":\"Test\",\"lastName\":\"Member\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "text"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{url}}/team-admin/v1/teams/{{team_id}}/users",
          "host": [
            "{{url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "team-admin",
            "v1",
            "teams",
            "{{team_id}}",
            "users"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Invites invite_email and returns the member: 201 for a new membership or 200 without another invitation for an existing member. Names are optional and used for a new account. Requires tmadmapi:team-users:write or tmadmapi:team:write."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
